WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
The Fazer chocolate company was founded in Finland in 1891.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
On the tour, you can see some of their vintage posters and packaging.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.500
Did you know Xylitol is a Finnish invention?

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.500
After peering through to the factory production line.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
You can spend ten minutes eating all the chocolate you like.